# 🎬 Movie Search App

A beautifully styled, responsive Movie Search application built with HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript. 

It uses the **OMDb API** to search for movies and display their posters, titles, and release years in a responsive grid layout.

## ✨ Features
* Clean, modern dark-themed UI.
* Responsive grid layout for movie cards.
* Hover animations and smooth transitions.
* Real-time search functionality.
* Graceful fallback to mock data if an API key isn't provided.
* Handles missing movie posters automatically.

## 🚀 How to Run
1. Ensure all files (`index.html`, `style.css`, `script.js`, and this `README.md`) are in the same folder.
2. Open `index.html` in any web browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge, etc.). 
3. No build tools or local servers are strictly required!

## 🔑 Activating Real Search (OMDb API)
By default, the app uses dummy data so you can see the layout immediately. To search the actual movie database of millions of films:

1. Go to [http://www.omdbapi.com/](http://www.omdbapi.com/) and request a **Free API Key**.
2. Open `script.js` in your favorite text editor.
3. Replace the `YOUR_API_KEY` placeholder on line 3 with your actual API key:
   ```javascript
   const API_KEY = '1234abcd'; // Example of what it might look like
